      "comment": "MACHZINE MAHONEY (11) has been racing well of late. Chased a good filly in a Breeders Challenge heat at her latest appearance at this circuit and distance, finishing second after racing parked. Draws on the back row but has winning claims with even luck. TANGO IN PARIS (5) is a colt by Poster Boy on debut for Jason Hewitt. Has recorded a win and a placing in two trials here so looks to have some ability. COBBITY CADENCE (7) has switched yards since last seen at Albion Park five weeks ago but has trialled and was a Redcliffe winner over a similar distance two back. SHOWEMHOW (10) draws for a trail and was an easy Young winner two back.",
